{
  "prompt": "Ultra-realistic RAW photo taken on an iPhone 13 using the rear camera. Natural smartphone look, no cinematic style, no filters, no HDR, no artificial blur. Looks like a real casual photo captured on the spot.\n\nIMPORTANT: keep my appearance 100% identical to the provided reference image. Same face, same proportions, same skin tone, same hairline. Do not alter facial features.\n\nScene: the exact same real-world location shown in the second reference image. The Christ statue appears at full real-life scale in the background, correctly proportioned and naturally integrated into the environment. Perspective and distance feel realistic, not exaggerated.\n\nI am standing casually, distracted, looking to the side (not facing the camera). Natural posture, relaxed body language. I am making a subtle peace sign with one hand, masculine and natural, not posed.\n\nOutfit: original Brazil 2002 football jersey with authentic colors and fabric texture, blue denim shorts with realistic wear and folds, Nike VaporMax Plus sneakers with accurate shape and materials.\n\nLighting: real outdoor daylight only, natural sun and ambient light. Realistic shadows and highlights like a normal iPhone photo. No dramatic lighting.\n\nImage realism: slight natural smartphone grain, true-to-life colors, realistic skin texture with visible pores and imperfections. Sharp focus, no depth-of-field effects. Everything must look like a real photo taken by a person, not AI-generated.",
  "camera": {
    "device": "iPhone 13",
